---
import RavenGridLayout from "../../layouts/RavenGridLayout.astro";
---

<RavenGridLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | RavenGrid"
  description="Privacy Policy for the RavenGrid UAS flight planning application."
>

  <header>
    <div class="nav">
      <a class="brand" href="/">RAVEN<span>GRID</span></a>

      <nav>
        <a href="/">RavenGrid</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <article>

      <div class="section-label">RAVENGRID / LEGAL</div>

      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

      <p class="updated">Last updated: September 8, 2026</p>

      <p>
        RavenØrix ("we," "us," or "our") operates the RavenGrid
        mobile application ("RavenGrid"). This Privacy Policy explains
        how information is handled when you use RavenGrid.
      </p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

      <p>
        RavenGrid may request access to your device location when you
        use features that depend on your current position. Location
        information is used to provide location-based flight planning,
        weather, aviation, mapping, and related information.
      </p>

      <p>
        RavenGrid does not require you to create an account and does
        not collect your name, email address, phone number, or other
        personal profile information through the application.
      </p>

      <h2>Location Information</h2>

      <p>
        If you grant location permission, RavenGrid may access your
        device's location while using location-dependent features.
        Location information is used to center maps and retrieve
        information relevant to your current position.
      </p>

      <p>
        RavenGrid does not sell, rent, or otherwise share your precise
        location information for advertising or marketing purposes.
      </p>

      <h2>Device and Aviation Data</h2>

      <p>
        RavenGrid displays information from external services,
        including weather, aviation, airspace, mapping, geomagnetic,
        and other data sources. Requests to these services may include
        information necessary to provide the requested data.
      </p>

      <p>
        RavenGrid may also access device-provided GNSS information
        when you use the application's positioning features.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>

      <p>
        RavenGrid may use third-party services to provide maps,
        weather information, aviation information, and other
        application functionality. These services may process
        information according to their own privacy policies.
      </p>

      <p>
        RavenGrid does not control the privacy practices of third-party
        services. Users should review the privacy policies of those
        services when appropriate.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Storage</h2>

      <p>
        RavenGrid does not maintain a user account system or a
        centralized personal profile database.
      </p>

      <p>
        Information used locally by the application may be stored on
        your device as necessary for application functionality.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>

      <p>
        RavenGrid is not directed toward children under the age of 13.
        We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Security</h2>

      <p>
        We take reasonable measures to protect information handled by
        RavenGrid. However, no method of electronic transmission or
        storage can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>

      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any
        changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision
        date.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>

      <p>
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or RavenGrid's
        privacy practices, please contact RavenØrix through the
        official RavenØrix website.
      </p>

      <p>
        <a href="https://ravenorix.com">Visit RavenØrix</a>
      </p>

    </article>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div>RAVEN<span>GRID</span></div>

    <div>
      <a href="/">RavenGrid</a>
    </div>

    <div>© 2026 RavenØrix</div>
  </footer>

</RavenGridLayout>

<style>
  :global(body) {
    background: #08090b;
    color: #d1d5db;
  }

  header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #24262a;
  }

  .nav {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 22px 28px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .brand {
    color: #f3f4f6;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .brand span,
  footer span {
    color: #a71930;
  }

  nav a,
  footer a {
    color: #8b9098;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  nav a:hover,
  footer a:hover {
    color: #fff;
  }

  main {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 90px 28px 120px;
  }

  article {
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .section-label {
    color: #a71930;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 18px 0 8px;
    color: #f3f4f6;
    font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 72px);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .updated {
    color: #666b73;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-bottom: 55px;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-top: 55px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    color: #f3f4f6;
    font-size: 23px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  p {
    color: #9ca1a9;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  a {
    color: #c22a43;
  }

  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid #24262a;
    padding: 28px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 25px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    color: #555960;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    main {
      padding-top: 65px;
    }

    footer {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>